WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A title card reads Learn Ethiopian Sign Language with Yekatit 23 School's Deaf Youth, Bahir Dar, Ethiopia.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A young woman in a pink shirt stands against a textured wall. The label says Family signs.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
She signs Mother.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
She signs Grandmother.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
She signs Father.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
She signs Grandfather.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
She signs Uncle's child.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
She signs Aunt's child.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
She signs Sister.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
She signs Brother.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
She signs Girl.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.000
She signs Woman.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:22.000
She signs Relative.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:39.500
Credits for Kal Center for Special Needs and Visions Global Empowerment.
